  "Our hook example (statement): 'This event planner ruined this bride's wedding'",
  "Hypothetical questions often fail to engage viewers because they specify an industry rather than telling a compelling story",
  "Making a strong statement creates curiosity and makes people want to hear what actually happened",
  "Hypothetical situations might get 2,000 views, whereas strong statements can end up in 200,000 views with the same message",
  "This thought process should be applied throughout the video to take content from 0 to 1 million views"
